"A giant fire-dragon head blasts a moving wall of blue-white plasma flame. Burning enemies feed it, widening it and making it last longer, up to a cap.","pack.weapons.P04.text":"Premium. A roaring cone of fire.","pack.weapons.P05.ability":"The pull zone collapses into a blast when it ends.","pack.weapons.P05.form":"Spinning ring cannon","pack.weapons.P05.name":"Black Hole Cannon","pack.weapons.P05.power":"Event Horizon","pack.weapons.P05.powerText":"A huge black hole pulls enemies in and slows them almost to a stop, then erupts and fires the captured debris outward.","pack.weapons.P05.text":"Premium. A dense orb that lands and pulls enemies in.","pack.weapons.P06.ability":"Toxic damage; each blade's return hit heals you a little.","pack.weapons.P06.form":"Eight spectral blades","pack.weapons.P06.name":"Twin Fang Chakrams","pack.weapons.P06.power":"Serpent Dance","pack.weapons.P06.powerText":"The chakrams split into 8 spectral blades spiralling around you, shredding enemies, then return with a burst of healing for every enemy struck.","pack.weapons.P06.text":"Premium. Two toxic ring blades that fly out and come back.","pack.weapons.P07.ability":"Lightning chains without losing strength.","pack.weapons.P07.form":"Floating crown of tesla coils","pack.weapons.P07.name":"Storm Crown","pack.weapons.P07.power":"Judgement Storm","pack.weapons.P07.powerText":"A colossal storm hammers enemy clusters with repeated strikes. Defeated enemies leave conductive nodes for more chains.","pack.weapons.P07.text":"Premium. Chain lightning from a crown of coils.","pack.weapons.P08.ability":"Enemies the drones kill release a mini drone for 5 seconds.","pack.weapons.P08.form":"Giant Queen Drone","pack.weapons.P08.name":"Hive Queen","pack.weapons.P08.power":"Swarm Apocalypse","pack.weapons.P08.powerText":"A giant Queen Drone releases a cloud of tiny attack drones that chase enemies. Expiring mini drones dive in for a final explosion.","pack.weapons.P08.text":"Premium. Three attack drones circle you and shoot.","pack.weapons.P09.ability":"Every shell leaves a burning crater that keeps damaging.","pack.weapons.P09.form":"Triple-barrel siege mortar","pack.weapons.P09.name":"Doomsday Mortar","pack.weapons.P09.power":"Extinction Event","pack.weapons.P09.powerText":"One gigantic meteor-like shell explodes into several secondary impacts. The main impact leaves a volcanic crater that erupts again and again until it fades.","pack.weapons.P09.text":"Premium. Heavy lobbed shells that burst where they land.","pack.weapons.P10.ability":"Kills speed up the swing (a combo), and hits slow enemies.","pack.weapons.P10.form":"Enormous double-bladed scythe","pack.weapons.P10.name":"Neon Reaper","pack.weapons.P10.power":"Frozen Massacre","pack.weapons.P10.powerText":"An enormous spectral ice scythe circles you. Frozen enemies shatter and launch icy fragments into the enemies around them.","pack.weapons.P10.text":"Premium. A spinning ice scythe sweep in front of you.","pack.weapons.W01.name":"Rivet Gun","pack.weapons.W01.text":"Fast single rivets at the nearest enemy.","pack.weapons.W02.name":"Scattergun","pack.weapons.W02.text":"A short fan of five pellets.","pack.weapons.W03.name":"Returning Saw","pack.weapons.W03.text":"A saw that flies out and comes back, cutting both ways.","pack.weapons.W04.name":"Arc Coil","pack.weapons.W04.text":"An instant arc that jumps to two more enemies.","pack.weapons.W05.name":"Foam Launcher","pack.weapons.W05.text":"Foam globs that leave a sticky slowing patch.","pack.weapons.W06.name":"Flame Sprayer","pack.weapons.W06.text":"A short cone of fire that sets enemies burning.","pack.weapons.W07.name":"Scrap Mortar","pack.weapons.W07.text":"Lobbed shells that burst where they land.","pack.weapons.W08.name":"Bolt Rail","pack.weapons.W08.text":"An instant rail line through everything in its path.","pack.weapons.W09.name":"Magnet Puck","pack.weapons.W09.text":"A puck that stops and pulls enemies together.","pack.weapons.W10.name":"Mine Dispenser",